iv>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.375</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.62.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nMichael's Copper Axe is an axe that has a reddish brown handle, along with a blade made of copper. It can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a> during a quest given by <a href=\"/wiki/Jenna\" title=\"Jenna\">Jenna</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Michael's Copper Axe can be found in 8 different spawn locations within the meadows as soon as the quest for it is accepted, in which it will have no owner, allowing anyone to take it.\n</p><p>When there is a thunderstorm, the axe has a unique ability to summon lightning onto the player holding it out with a 33% chance of happening each time lightning forms. This ability comes in handy to change certain trees and rocks into materials like <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Trees</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Rock\" title=\"Electrified Rock\">Electrified Rocks</a>\n</p><p>Though, when this ability does occur, the axe has a 50% chance to tarnish because of the lightning it summons, meaning it will lose the ability to control where lightning strikes, and it will change the axe's appearance and name by renaming the axe to \"Michael's Tarnished Axe\", and turning the handle a pale brown and the blade into\n</p><p>a very dark brown color, meaning the player will need to find a new one to get the ability back. The axe will still be able to chop down trees normally in this condition.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"14987346ee8f25e02d5690afa3150832\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Copper_axe-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:168px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Copper_axe.jpg\" title=\"Copper axe.jpg (167 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:168px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7a/Copper_axe.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/168?cb=20260111003024\" title=\"Copper axe.jpg (167 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Current map of all spawn locations of Michael’s Copper Axe as of V1.98.2+\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Copper axe.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Copper_axe.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Current map of all spawn locations of Michael’s Copper Axe as of V1.98.2+\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Copper axe.jpg (167 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Current map of all spawn locations of Michael’s Copper Axe as of V1.98.2+\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Copper axe.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Copper_axe.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Current map of all spawn locations of Michael’s Copper Axe as of V1.98.2+\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7a/Copper_axe.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/168?cb=20260111003024\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Current map of all spawn locations of Michael’s Copper Axe as of V1.98.2+</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This Copper Axe belongs to Mike Miner aka Michael.</li>\n<li>As of the Flowering Meadows Revamp update, the axe will now have a chance to spawn on one of 6 workbenches scattered throughout the upper-levels of the meadows.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829010914\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 74/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1938/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019472/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%